          "title": "You'll want to know: आगामी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आगामी — āgāmī — \"coming, next\". It stands before the time word and takes its ending: आगामिनि सप्ताहे — \"next week\"; आगामिनि संवत्सरे — \"next year\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "āgāmī is the nominative of āgāmin \"coming, approaching\", built from ā-√gam \"come\", the root √gam \"go\" with ā \"toward\" (MW; CDIAL 1048). From \"coming\" it means \"next, future\"."
            }
          ]
        },
